2014 a friendly voice assistant that answers your questions as you explore the night sky in VR. Ask about any constellation, star, planet, or astronomical phenomenon and get a clear, engaging answer without leaving the experience.\n\nDesigned for all audiences \u2014 from curious beginners to students and educators. Responses are conversational and jargon-free.\n\nIncluded at no extra cost, up to 100 queries per day. The AI Guide is an Early Access feature and needs an internet connection and Meta account sign-in; everything else works offline.\n\nLearn more: www.immsci.com/home/constellationsvr/ (http://www.immsci.com/home/constellationsvr/)\nQuestions? Contact support@immsci.com\n", "created_date": 1786485358, "id": "27961816423503092", "version": "3.5", "version_code": 534, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6162691550508893", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28007080565643344"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "793535632318161"}]}, "change_log": "ConstellationsVR now includes an AI Guide \u2014 a friendly voice assistant that answers your questions as you explore the night sky in VR. Ask about any constellation, star, planet, or astronomical phenomenon and get a clear, engaging answer without leaving the experience.\n\nDesigned for all audiences \u2014 from curious beginners to students and educators. Responses are conversational and jargon-free.\n\nIncluded at no extra cost, up to 100 queries per day. The AI Guide is an Early Access feature and needs an internet connection and Meta account sign-in; everything else works offline.\n\nLearn mo